<title>USA: ITT Educational Services enters Nevada.</title>
<headline>ITT Educational Services enters Nevada.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS, Ind. 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>ITT Educational Services Inc, a private college system focused on technology oriented programs of study, said Monday it received a license to open a new ITT Technical Institute in Henderson, Nev.</p>
<p>The new campus, near Las Vegas, will be the company's first in the state of Nevada and will increase the number of ITT Technical Institutes to 60 in 27 states.</p>
<p>First classes in Nevada will start in June, the company said.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
